{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53974","headline":"偈 八 · 景岑","name":"偈 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满眼本非色，满耳本非声。\n文殊常触目，观音塞耳根。\n会三元一体，达四本同真。\n堂堂法界性，无佛亦无人。\n（《祖堂集》卷十七、《景德传灯录》卷十。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"景岑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}